# The open-core "manual" bucket is byte-copied verbatim into the generated
# flyto-warroom tree by flyto2-open-core-export. Pin it to LF and never apply
# CRLF conversion, so a regen on ANY platform (Windows dev, Mac, CI) reproduces
# the published repo's line endings exactly instead of reintroducing CRLF churn.
src/open_core_manual/** -text
